## Core principles for this codebase
- Modular monolith
- Design system first (components/ui)
- Information architecture and progressive disclosure before features
- Multi-tenancy via tenant_id + RLS from day one
- Empty, loading and error states are part of every feature

## Gotchas
- All UI must come from the design system
- Never invent one-off styles
- Auth context always carries tenant_id
- Prefer composition over new components

